  '18g plant protein, zinc & folate': '18 g ya phurotheni ya zwimela, zinc na folate',
  'Super Maize Meal': 'Mugayo wa Mavhele',
  '400g (cooked into fluffy pap)': '400 g (wo bikwaho wa vha vhuswa ho leluwaho)',
  '2.5kg bag': 'Saga ḽa 2.5 kg',
  'Fortified Zinc & Vitamin A': 'Zinc na Vitamin A zwo Engedzwaho',
