  '1 medium onion, diced': 'Eiee nthihi ya vhukati, yo ṱhuṱhuwaho',
  'Quercetin & Prebiotics': 'Quercetin na dzi-Prebiotic',
  'Sweet Carrot': 'Kherothi i Ḓifhaho',
  '2 carrots, grated or cubed': 'Kherothi mbili, dzo kwathiwaho kana dzo ṱhuṱhuwaho zwipiḓa',
  'Beta-carotene for eye health': 'Beta-carotene ya mutakalo wa maṱo',
  'Fresh Spinach / Morogo': 'Sipinashi / Morogo Muswa',
  '1/2 bunch, chopped': '1/2 ya tshigwada, yo ṱhuṱhuwaho',
  '1 large bunch': 'Tshigwada tshihulwane tshithihi',
  'Vitamin C & Folate (enhances iron uptake)': 'Vitamin C na Folate (zwi engedza u mamiwa ha aene)',
  'Sunflower Oil & Salt': 'Mapfura a Sunflower na Muṋo',
  '1.5 tbsp': 'Lebula khulwane dza 1.5',
  '750ml bottle': 'Bodelo ḽa 750 ml',
  'Vitamin E & healthy lipids': 'Vitamin E na mapfura a mutakalo',
  'If using dried beans, rinse and soak overnight in cold water. In the morning, boil in fresh water for 35 minutes until tender.': 'Arali ni tshi shumisa nawa dzo omiswaho, dzi ṱanzweni ni dzi nyorise vhusiku hoṱhe kha maḓi a rotholaho. Nga matsheloni, dzi vhiliseni kha maḓi maswa minithi dza 35 u swika dzi tshi leluwa.',
  'In a wide saucepan, heat sunflower oil over medium heat. Add chopped onions and cook until golden brown (about 6 minutes).': 'Kha pani yo andaho, dudedzani mapfura a sunflower mulilo wa vhukati. Engedzani eiee dzo ṱhuṱhuwaho ni bike u swika dzi tshi vha dza musuku (minithi dzi ṱoḓaho u vha 6).',
  'Stir in grated carrots and curry or tomato paste if available. Cook for 2 minutes to release natural aromatics.': 'Ṱanganyani kherothi dzo kwathiwaho na kheri kana tshikhwaṱhisi tsha tomathisi arali tshi hone. Bikani minithi dza 2 u bvisa minukho ya mbumbo.',
  'Add the tender cooked beans along with 1/2 cup of the cooking broth. Lower heat and let simmer gently for 12 minutes until gravy thickens.': 'Engedzani nawa dzo bikwaho dzo leluwaho kathihi na 1/2 ya khaphu ya muṱo wa u bika. Fhungudzani mulilo ni vhilise nga u leluwa minithi dza 12 u swika muṱo u tshi khwaṱha.',
  'Fold in the fresh chopped spinach during the last 3 minutes of simmering so it stays vibrant and nutrient-packed.': 'Dzhenisani sipinashi yo ṱhuṱhuwaho kha minithi dza 3 dza u fhedza dza u vhila uri i dzule i dala nahone i na pfushi.',
  'Meanwhile, bring 3 cups of lightly salted water to a rolling boil. Slowly whisk in maize meal with a wooden spoon, cover tightly, and steam on low for 15 minutes into fluffy pap.': 'Tshifhingani itshi, vhilisani khaphu tharu dza maḓi a re na muṋo muṱuku. Fhothani mugayo zwiṱuku nga zwiṱuku nga lebula ḽa muri, fukedzani nga u khwaṱha, ni bike nga mutsho mulilo wa fhasi minithi dza 15 u swika u tshi vha vhuswa ho leluwaho.',
  'Spoon a generous mound of steaming pap into each bowl, ladle the savory bean & greens stew on top, and serve warm.': 'Dzhenisani mulu muhulwane wa vhuswa vhu fhisaho kha ndilo iṅwe na iṅwe, shelani mbiṱo ya nawa na miroho nṱha, ni ṋee zwi tshi fhisa.',
  'Cook the entire 1kg bag of beans in one go on the weekend. Portion the remaining cooked beans into containers and freeze for up to 3 months.': 'Bikani saga ḽoṱhe ḽa 1 kg ḽa nawa luthihi kha mafhedziselo a vhege. Kovhani nawa dzo bikwaho dzo salaho kha zwilongo ni dzi gwamise u swika miṅwedzi ya 3.',
  'Fisherman’s Pilchard & Braised Cabbage Stir-Fry': 'Pilchard dza Muredzi wa Khovhe na Khavhishi yo Hadzhiwaho',
  'Omega-3 powerhouse with calcium-rich natural tomato gravy': 'Maanḓa a Omega-3 a re na sosi ya tomathisi ya mbumbo yo pfumaho nga calcium',
  'An affordable meal packed with marine omega-3 fatty acids, bone-strengthening calcium, and crisp braised green cabbage.': 'Tshiḽiwa tshi sa ḓuri tsho ḓalaho dzi-omega-3 dza lwanzhe, calcium i khwaṱhisaho marambo, na khavhishi dala yo khwaṱhaho yo bikwaho.',
  'Very Easy': 'Zwi Leluwa Vhukuma',
