  '400g tin': 'Thini ya 400 g',
  '38g Marine Protein, High Omega-3 EPA/DHA': '38 g ya phurotheni ya lwanzhe, Omega-3 EPA/DHA nnzhi',
  '1/2 whole head (~600g), shredded': '1/2 ya ṱhoho yo fhelelaho (i ṱoḓaho u vha 600 g), yo ṱhuṱhuwaho',
  'Whole 1.2kg head': 'Ṱhoho yo fhelelaho ya 1.2 kg',
