  '1 onion, sliced into rings': 'Eiee nthihi, yo ṱhuṱhuwaho ya vha mapfene',
  'Flavonoid antioxidants': 'Dzi-antioxidant dza flavonoid',
  'Curry Powder & Minced Garlic': 'Phaudara ya Kheri na Galiki yo Gayiwaho',
  '1 tsp curry, 2 cloves garlic': 'Lebula ḽiṱuku ḽithihi ḽa kheri, zwipiḓa zwivhili zwa galiki',
  'Pantry spice pack': 'Phakhethe ya zwinukhisi zwa khabodo',
  'Cooking Oil': 'Mapfura a u Bika',
  '1 tbsp': 'Lebula ḽihulwane ḽithihi',
  'Essential fatty acids': 'Dzi-fatty acid dza ndeme',
  'Heat oil in a large skillet or pot. Add sliced onions and minced garlic, sautéing for 4 minutes until tender.': 'Dudedzani mapfura kha pani khulwane kana khalini. Engedzani eiee dzo ṱhuṱhuwaho na galiki yo gayiwaho, ni hadzhe minithi dza 4 u swika zwi tshi leluwa.',
  'Add curry powder, stirring constantly for 30 seconds to bloom the spices without burning.': 'Engedzani phaudara ya kheri, ni tshi ṱanganya tshifhinga tshoṱhe sekondo dza 30 uri zwinukhisi zwi bvise munukho zwi sa swi.',
  'Add shredded cabbage in two batches. Toss vigorously with wooden spoons over high heat until slightly wilted but still retaining a pleasant snap (about 5-7 minutes).': 'Engedzani khavhishi yo ṱhuṱhuwaho nga zwigwada zwivhili. Ṱanganyani nga maanḓa nga lebula dza muri mulilo wa nṱha u swika i tshi dzhiela zwiṱuku fhedzi i tshi kha ḓi vha yo khwaṱha (minithi dzi ṱoḓaho u vha 5-7).',
  'Open the can of pilchards. Pour the fish and rich tomato sauce directly over the braised cabbage. Gently break the large fish pieces into chunky flakes with your spoon.': 'Vulani thini ya pilchard. Shelani khovhe na sosi ya tomathisi thwii nṱha ha khavhishi. Pwasani nga u leluwa zwipiḓa zwihulwane zwa khovhe nga lebula ḽaṋu.',
  'Reduce heat to medium-low, cover, and allow the pilchard sauce to simmer into the cabbage for 5-6 minutes.': 'Fhungudzani mulilo u vhe wa vhukati-fhasi, fukedzani, ni tendele sosi ya pilchard i vhile na khavhishi minithi dza 5-6.',
  'Taste and season with black pepper and a touch of salt. Serve over rice, pap, or fresh crusty wholewheat bread.': 'Lingani tshinukhelo ni nukhise nga pepere ntswu na muṋo muṱuku. Ṋeani na raisi, vhuswa, kana vhurotho vhuswa ha goroi.',
  'The soft bones in canned pilchards are packed with bioavailable calcium equivalent to several glasses of milk—leave them in!': 'Marambo o leluwaho a pilchard dza thini o ḓala calcium i mamiwaho nga u leluwa i linganaho na galasi dzi si gathi dza mafhi — a litsheni!',
  'Aromatic Brown Lentil & Butternut Curry': 'Kheri ya Lentili dza Buraweni na Butternut i Nukhelaho',
  'Speedy 30-minute comforting plant curry with nutty brown rice': 'Kheri ya zwimela i ṱavhanyaho ya minithi dza 30 na raisi ya buraweni',
  'A deeply aromatic, warming curry pairing fiber-loaded brown lentils with sweet roasted butternut squash and wholesome brown rice.': 'Kheri i re na munukho u dzikaho, i dudedzaho i ṱanganyaho lentili dza buraweni dzi re na faibara nnzhi na butternut i ḓifhaho yo ṱhongiwaho na raisi ya buraweni ya mutakalo.',
  'Vegan': 'Ya Vegan',
